{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全国握手会で同じレーンのかずみん(高山かずみちゃん)について少し書かせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんはウサギちゃんの形のファー？\n首に巻く暖かいのをよく着けてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてしゃべり方はいつもあの独特の声です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに聞き取りにくいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑\nあたしはねぇ\nのことを\nあっしはねぇ\nと言ってます..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそんなかずみんが大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんから来たMAILは全部保護してあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいい事ばっかり書いてくれるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気が湧いてくる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもそのままの優しくて面白い素敵なお姉ちゃんでいてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてゆっきーな大学合格おめでとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと学業も頑張ってたから\n合格って聞いたときは凄い嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユッキーナは中々最近会ってないけど、会った時はいつも変顔のクオリティーが上がってて素晴らしいと思うよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもホドホドにね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして前のblogの写メは\nおにぃちゃんと撮ってる写メじゃないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒におうどんをお手伝いした可愛い女の子です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミサミサ20歳の誕生日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のレッスンの時みんなと祝えて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣は行きましたか？の質問返しをしまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは地元の友達と、友達の家族と行ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもすごく並んでたのでお願い事はしてないんだけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたまお兄ちゃん達も来てて、お兄ちゃんがまあやの事をお願いしてくれたみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにコメント読みました...\nビックリしたよ!!\nまあやの事をお願いしてくれた方がいて...何で？いいの？って思ってコメント読みながら１人で声を出してました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しまあやの事も..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの飼ってるペットの種類は...\nタイニープードルで、名前はポテト"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前の由来は...まあやがお芋が大好きだから♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつも元気をもらいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも皆のコメントを楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだから１人でゆっくり読ませてもらうことが多いです..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会かずみんfamilyの皆様、宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしています♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと初めての方も沢山おられると思いますが、まあやと少しの時間を楽しんでもらえるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまあや族の皆様いつも遠くから来てくれてありがとうございます\n近くの方もいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくすごく楽しみにしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方も来てくれるのを楽しみにしてます〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワクドキドキ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こられない方も写メとりますので、服の感想を聞かせて下さ〜い♪\n待っててね〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは最近迄お肉が食べれなかったんだけど、皆は苦手な食べ物ありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/04/0480679/0016.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}